                    "text": "na kilim aak lamuqu siin hutan.",
                    "textCh": "我去找玉米和地瓜。",
                    "sound": "text/sound/65607/918001"
                },
                "2": {
                    "text": "nii aak maqansiap tu i’isaq a vanglaz.",
